    "date_str": "2026-07-01",
    "description": "We had a plan to reduce fuel dependence. We cancelled it",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/We-had-a-plan-to-reduce-fuel-dependence-We-cancelled-it/4-794009",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
