    "chunk_text": "Future Builders Lab to help students navigate their future after A/Ls\n\nFor many students, life after Advanced Level examinations marks a turning point defined by both opportunity and uncertainty. While school provides structure, the transition into adulthood rarely comes with a clear roadmap.\n\nFuture Builders Lab is a newly launched four-week immersive experience designed to help students understand their strengths, explore emerging career pathways, and gain clarity on the opportunities available in a rapidly changing world.\n\nThe program is a guided yet exploratory journey that helps young people move from uncertainty to direction through self-discovery, industry exposure, mentorship, and practical learning. By combining future-focused learning with real-world perspectives from entrepreneurs, business leaders, and industry practitioners, it equips participants with the confidence to make more intentional decisions about the decade ahead.\n\nDeveloped by Generation ALPHA in collaboration with TiE Colombo, the initiative responds to a growing need for young people to navigate an increasingly complex landscape shaped by technological disruption, evolving career pathways, and expanded access to opportunity. While students spend years preparing for examinations, few opportunities exist to help them understand themselves, explore what is possible, and build a practical framework for the future."
  },
