    "description": "CCPI spikes again in June to three-year high 6.8%",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CCPI-spikes-again-in-June-to-three-year-high-6-8/34-794042",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
