    "description": "Current account deficit widens in May, trade gap nearly doubles",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Current-account-deficit-widens-in-May-trade-gap-nearly-doubles/34-794043",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
